            "description": {
              "content": "Returns the list of available distribution files for a given project. Each file entry includes the filename, download URL, hash digests, and optional metadata such as requires-python and data-yanked attributes. The response supports HTML (PEP 503) and JSON (PEP 691) formats.",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
